# Secrets / credentials — never commit these.
# Nothing in this repo writes a credential file: demo-run-of-show.ps1 keeps
# the whole credential document in memory and pipes it to kubectl over stdin.
# These patterns stay as a safety net against anything created by hand.
*.json
*.env
.env*
azure-credentials*
azure-sp-config.json
kubeconfig*
*.kubeconfig

# PowerPoint lock files
~$*.pptx
~$*.ppt

# kind / local cluster state
.kind/
